    PROJECT GUMBALL | Clean Category Menu v4
    Standalone UI-only menu inspired by the supplied screenshot.
    No Kicia/UE code, no gameplay features, no external libraries.

    PC: RightShift toggles the menu.
    Mobile: a small G button toggles the menu.
    Settings > General: Unload Gumball.

    Future feature integrations can use:
        getgenv().GumballMenu.RegisterPage(tabName, categoryName, buildFunction)
        getgenv().GumballMenu.RegisterCleanup(cleanupFunction)
    buildFunction(contentFrame) may return a cleanup function.
]]

